## Advanced Beehive UI
ui.projectbee:info.advance_beehive=§eAdvance Beehive§r\nAn automated beehive that processes\nbee products and produces honeycombs.\n\n§bBee Input§r — Insert a bee or filled cage\n§bBee Storage§r — Stores working bees\n§bCatalyst Slot§r — Insert a required catalyst\n§bOutput Grid§r — Collect produced items\n§bUpgrade Slots§r — Install machine upgrades\n\nThe beehive automatically processes\nrecipes while active.
ui.projectbee:info.advance_beehive_expanded=§eExpanded Advance Beehive§r\nAn expanded beehive with additional\nbee storage capacity.\n\n§bBee Input§r — Insert a bee or filled cage\n§bBee Storage§r — Stores working bees\n§bCatalyst Slot§r — Insert a required catalyst\n§bOutput Grid§r — Collect produced items\n§bUpgrade Slots§r — Install machine upgrades\n\nPlace an Extension Box directly above or\nbelow the beehive to expand its capacity.

