## Centrifuge UI
ui.projectbee:info.centrifuge=§eCentrifuge§r\nProcesses honeycombs into raw materials.\n\n§bInput Slot§r — Insert a honeycomb\n§bOutput Grid§r — Collect processed items\n\nOperates without power at standard speed.
ui.projectbee:info.powered_centrifuge=§ePowered Centrifuge§r\nAn energy-powered centrifuge that runs\nat twice the speed of the base version.\n\n§bInput Slot§r — Insert a honeycomb\n§bOutput Grid§r — Collect processed items\n\nRequires §a500 FE§r per operation.\nProcesses at §a2× speed§r when powered.

